# Scoped ignore for rust/Dockerfile builds only; takes precedence over the root
# .dockerignore. The build context stays the repo root, but only the paths the
# Rust build graph COPYs from the context are kept: rust/ (all `COPY rust .`
# sources and rust/web/migrations) and k8s/base/game (register target manifests).
# `*` plus `!` keep-list; the Dockerfile and this ignore file are always sent
# regardless. The standard excludes are re-applied here because this file
# replaces the root one.
*
!rust
!k8s/base/game
**/.git
**/node_modules
**/target
